{"kp_id": "zj-029.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-029", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "天溪等肋间穴：在穴旁约五分刺入肋间隙，勿正对骨面直刺；亦可透刺。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp18"], "chapter_id": "zj-029.c01", "evidence_quote": "靠过来的五分的地方下针", "seg_from": 4, "seg_to": 5, "start_s": 15.51, "end_s": 28.65, "citation": {"youtube_id": "CG2Dmx-XOFM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CG2Dmx-XOFM&t=15s", "series": "zj", "episode": 29, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 29", "start_s": 15.51, "end_s": 28.65}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-029.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-029", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "乳房硬块无单一特效穴，须视所在经络（脾/胃等）选经取穴。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.sp"], "chapter_id": "zj-029.c01", "evidence_quote": "没有说乳癌一个特效穴位，有要看你在哪条路", "seg_from": 10, "seg_to": 16, "start_s": 49.19, "end_s": 88.615, "citation": {"youtube_id": "CG2Dmx-XOFM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CG2Dmx-XOFM&t=49s", "series": "zj", "episode": 29, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 29", "start_s": 49.19, "end_s": 88.61}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-029.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-029", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "硬块在云门—中府一线取肺经；在周荣—胸乡一线取脾经。初期硬块灸优于针。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.lu", "meridian.sp", "acupoint.sp20"], "chapter_id": "zj-029.c01", "evidence_quote": "初期的硬块出来的时候，灸比针好灸", "seg_from": 63, "seg_to": 65, "start_s": 326.05, "end_s": 351.63, "citation": {"youtube_id": "CG2Dmx-XOFM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CG2Dmx-XOFM&t=326s", "series": "zj", "episode": 29, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 29", "start_s": 326.05, "end_s": 351.63}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "周融=周荣；胸腔/胸香=胸乡", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-029.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-029", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "大包约在极泉下六寸，为脾之大络，统诸经络，虚实皆可；亦治手挛不能握拳等。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp21", "acupoint.ht1", "concept.luo_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-029.c02", "evidence_quote": "从极拳下六寸，就是我们的大包穴", "seg_from": 93, "seg_to": 162, "start_s": 484.57, "end_s": 854.26, "citation": {"youtube_id": "CG2Dmx-XOFM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CG2Dmx-XOFM&t=484s", "series": "zj", "episode": 29, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 29", "start_s": 484.57, "end_s": 854.26}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "极拳=极泉", "source": "llm_read"}
